OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FAngela Rayner confirms the government
OL,8,Fwill present plans to Parliament aimed
OL,9,Fat preventing Andrew Harper's killers'
OL,10,Fearly release
OL,12,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham insists he
OL,13,Fis "increasingly confident" he will be
OL,14,Fable to stop PC Andrew Harper's
OL,15,Fkillers being released from prison
OL,16,Fearly, despite saying last week the
OL,17,Fmen would be eligible for the early
OL,18,Frelease scheme.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FWriting on social media on Tuesday,
OL,8,Fthe PM said he has been "pushing for
OL,9,Ffurther progress" on the issue, and
OL,10,Fhas "not accepted that it is
OL,11,Fimpossible to do more".
OL,13,F"I have asked the Justice Secretary to
OL,14,Ffast-track the development of a plan
OL,15,Ffor presentation to Parliament early
OL,16,Fnext month to create more headroom
OL,17,Fwithin the prison system," he said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,F"I am increasingly confident that a
OL,8,Fmore focused approach along these
OL,9,Flines will allow us to reduce the
OL,10,Fnumber of people released early and,
OL,11,Fin the case of the most serious
OL,12,Foffenders like those convicted of the
OL,13,Fkilling of PC Harper, prevent their
OL,14,Fearly release altogether."
OL,16,FDebbie Adlam, mother of PC Andrew
OL,17,FHarper, told Good Morning Britain, "We
OL,18,Fdread the day they get out"
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FThe issues surrounding the prison
OL,8,Fovercrowding crisis and the early
OL,9,Frelease scheme have become Burnham's
OL,10,Ffirst major hurdle as prime minister -
OL,11,Fafter launching a review of the
OL,12,Fscheme, the government announced last
OL,13,FMonday that people convicted of rape,
OL,14,Fserious child sex offences and
OL,15,Fgrooming would be exempt from early
OL,16,Frelease.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris
OL,8,Fapologised to the family of PC Harper
OL,9,Flast Tuesday, saying "we couldn't draw
OL,10,Fthe exemptions wide enough to include
OL,11,Fmanslaughter as well".
OL,13,FBut the government now appears to be
OL,14,Fpaving the way for a U-turn on the
OL,15,Fpolicy, with Burnham signaling
OL,16,FHarper's killers are unlikely to be
OL,17,Freleased in January as planned.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FThe PM said he will free up more space
OL,8,Fin the prison estate by putting some
OL,9,Fmen in women's prisons, removing more
OL,10,Fforeign national offenders, and
OL,11,Fallowing for the release of lower risk
OL,12,Fprisoners on Imprisonment for Public
OL,13,FProtection (IPP) sentences.
OL,15,FWhat has the Burnham government said
OL,16,Fabout the early release scheme?
OL,18,FJuly 22 - Burnham announces he will
OL,19,Fpause and review the early release
OL,20,Fscheme after outrage at plans to
OL,21,Frelease Andrew Harper's killers early.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FAugust 4 - Review concludes that
OL,8,Foffenders convicted of rape, serious
OL,9,Fchild sex offences and grooming
OL,10,Foffences will not be released early,
OL,11,Fbut there was no way to exclude Andrew
OL,12,FHarper's killers from early release.
OL,14,FAugust 7 - Government announces an
OL,15,Furgent review of grooming gang members
OL,16,Fdue to be released under the plans,
OL,17,Fafter concerns raised about a legal
OL,18,Floophole.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FAugust 10, 11:30am - Number 10 says
OL,8,FHarper's killers definitely won't be
OL,9,Freleased, because it's "not possible"
OL,10,Fto exempt "one or two offenders"
OL,11,Fconvicted of manslaughter from the
OL,12,Fearly release scheme.
OL,14,FAugust 10, 10pm - By Monday evening,
OL,15,FBurnham had asked the Justice
OL,16,FSecretary to look at options to keep
OL,17,FPC Harper's killers in prison.
OL,26,@qD@XOUqD@eO]rD@KOUrD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30909
