CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FAugust 11 - Burnham says he's
OL,8,F"increasingly confident" he will be
OL,9,Fable to stop PC Andrew Harper's
OL,10,Fkillers being released.
OL,12,FBurnham also wrote on Tuesday: "I
OL,13,Frecognise that, even with all these
OL,14,Fchanges, there will be concerns from
OL,15,Fmany victims about who will still be
OL,16,Freleased early for other offences.
OL,18,F"I am doing all I can, but it is
OL,19,Fsimply not possible to prevent all
OL,20,Foffenders from being released early
OL,21,Fwithout the prison system collapsing."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FSpeaking to Good Morning Britain on
OL,8,FTuesday, Rayner said "the prime
OL,9,Fminister has been really clear he will
OL,10,Fdo everything that he can do to
OL,11,Fensure" Jessie Cole and Albert Bowers'
OL,12,Fwon't be released early.
OL,14,FShe said the justice secretary will
OL,15,Foutline plans in Parliament in
OL,16,FSeptember to prevent their release.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FEarlier, while also speaking to Good
OL,8,FMorning Britain, Harper's mother,
OL,9,FDebbie Adlam, said someone from the
OL,10,FPM's office called her to say the PM
OL,11,Fis "trying to do everything that he
OL,12,Fcan and he's feeling more confident
OL,13,Fthat something can be done".
OL,15,FBut she noted: "Nothing has been done,
OL,16,Fnothing has been found yet, until it
OL,17,Fhappens here we sit."
OL,19,FShe also said she felt the government
OL,20,Fhad been very "soft" on the issue.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FThe announcement comes amid pressure
OL,8,Ffrom PC Harper's family and the police
OL,9,Fnot to allow Jessie Cole and Albert
OL,10,FBowers, who were sentenced to 13 years
OL,11,Ffor manslaughter, to be freed in
OL,12,FJanuary under existing plans.
OL,14,FOn Monday, Downing Street said it was
OL,15,F"not possible" to exempt "one or two
OL,16,Foffenders" convicted of manslaughter
OL,17,Ffrom the early release scheme, but on
OL,18,FTuesday they changed tact.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@NO]wD@ZOUxD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30913
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris will now
OL,8,Flook at ways to keep "a greater number
OL,9,Fof the most serious offenders" behind
OL,10,Fbars, No 10 said.
OL,12,FA government spokesperson said: "The
OL,13,Fprime minister has asked the Justice
OL,14,FSecretary to work through further
OL,15,Foptions to keep a greater number of
OL,16,Fthe most serious offenders in prison,
OL,17,Fincluding the killers of PC Harper."
OL,26,@pD@VOUqD@^O]tD@aOUyD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30914
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FAdlam told ITV News said she would
OL,8,Flike a meeting with Burnham to discuss
OL,9,Fhis son's killers and said no one from
OL,10,Fthe government had been in touch with
OL,11,Fher about the early release of her
OL,12,Fson's killers.
OL,14,FHe said: "I'm just really angry now
OL,15,Fbecause our emotions are going
OL,16,Fround... we're getting twisted inside,
OL,17,Fwith what is happening.
OL,19,F"My life's on hold while this is going
OL,20,Fon. I've got to try and hold
OL,21,Feverything else together."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30915
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FPC Harper was fatally injured when he
OL,8,Fgot caught in a strap attached to the
OL,9,Fback of a car and was dragged down a
OL,10,Fcountry road as the killers fled the
OL,11,Fscene of a quad bike theft in
OL,12,FSulhamstead, Berkshire, in 2019.
OL,14,FTwo out of three of PC Harper's
OL,15,Fkillers, Cole and Bowers, are set to
OL,16,Fbe released halfway through their 13-
OL,17,Fyear sentences, after being convicted
OL,18,Fof manslaughter in 2020.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30916
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FSome 5,000 people are expected to be
OL,8,Freleased early under sentencing
OL,9,Fchanges, down from 6,000 after some
OL,10,Fexemptions were announced as part of
OL,11,Fan urgent review of the scheme to
OL,12,Ftackle jail overcrowding.
OL,14,FHowever, more than 880,000 people have
OL,15,Fsigned a petition calling for PC
OL,16,FHarper's killers to remain in jail.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30917
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FNumber 10 said on Monday that
OL,8,Fmanslaughter of an emergency worker
OL,9,Fwas "not a standalone offence" and it
OL,10,Fwas "not possible to simply exclude
OL,11,Fone or two offenders" within the wider
OL,12,Fcategory of manslaughter.
OL,14,FThe early release changes were part of
OL,15,Fthe Sentencing Act passed earlier this
OL,16,Fyear that cut the minimum amount of
OL,17,Ftime many offenders would have to
OL,18,Fspend in prison.
OL,26,@qD@EOUqD@^O]rD@EOUsD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
