CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786504702
OL,3,CBurnham 'confident' he can prevent
OL,4,Cearly release of Andrew Harper's
OL,5,Ckillers
OL,7,FThose freed will face tougher
OL,8,Fprobation conditions, including
OL,9,Felectronic monitoring, random drug
OL,10,Ftesting and possible bans from
OL,11,Fdriving, pubs and events such as
OL,12,Ffootball matches.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/18
